# The ability half of "spells that can target only Walls or abilities that
# can target only Walls": Dwarven Demolition Team's `AB$ Destroy | ValidTgts$
# Wall` is an ability that can target only Walls, so Wall of Shadows is not a
# legal target. The scripted controller does not validate its queued target
# (see protection-from-red-refuses-bolt-on-resolution), so naming Wall of
# Shadows isolates the CR 608.2b re-check: the ability fizzles and both Walls
# survive, the Team tapped for its cost.
startturn ai
advance 3
queue targets 1
queue action ai activate 2 0
passpriority
